      "bullets": [
        "Nature study reveals brain formation stems from two parallel neural ectoderm lineages, overturning classical uniform single-origin developmental models.",
        "Advanced single-cell lineage tracing shows separate progenitor streams establish distinct regional identities and functional brain circuits.",
        "Offers neuro-inspired AI researchers biological principles for modularity, favoring dual-lineage architectural initialization over uniform weight scaling."
      ]
